<title>USA: Northside ISD, Texas, won by ABN AMRO.</title>
<headline>Northside ISD, Texas, won by ABN AMRO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Securities said it won $20 million of Northside Ind Sch Dist, Texas, school building general obligation bonds, Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 5.66 percent.</p>
</text>
